From 03e28f0faa57e43958a7be856498ca514862bbab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:14:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fonts: add Cyrillic (U+0400-U+04FF) to the built-in font

Russian, Ukrainian and other Cyrillic messages showed boxes. Open Sans
covers the range; the font is regenerated with regenerate.sh
(lv_font_conv 1.5.3, which also rasterizes a few existing glyphs very
slightly differently).
